ut-of-Home (AOOH) and Railway Out-of-Home (ROOH) advertising services that include spaces within and outside airport terminal buildings; and digital and static hoardings across railway stations and railway land. The company also provides Metro Out-of-Home (MOOH) advertising, including advertisements on Platform Screen Doors (PSDs), and offers in-shop branding services. In addition, it offers various traditional city media formats, including hoardings, billboards, unipole, multipoles, pole kiosks, wall wraps, wall paintings, lollipops, gantries, in-shop branding, and other related media assets. Further, the company serves corporate, non-corporate, government, and non-government organizations, including public sector undertakings, such as banking and financial services, insurance, education, healthcare, hosiery, jewellery, FMCG, oil and gas, power and energy, steel, mining, and infrastructure services sector; government departments, including tourism and communication agencies at the state and central levels; and advertising agencies, media buying firms, and marketing consultancies. Century Business Media Limited was incorporated in 1999 and is based in Kolkata, India.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795257052},"analyst":null,"cap":"Penny","caFix":null,"fetched":1795257051,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Century Business Media\" stock when:90d","items":[{"t":"Century Business Media Limited Share Price - Live CENTURYOOH Stock Price & Chart","s":"Upstox","d":1795231812,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE1xR21MWlRvVDlqV01VcC1zZ2ppaDgwSDUtRTd2MzZwT0hXYzROeWhMaGQxNjVTSHBmZUhmakp4SU44RUUwbUtONnlFdWVvdVRKblJfZ0VaWVlJUjBpWEFTRWxlblFzUEpQajRRcE5ReVRSX1hpN2NMdg?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Century Business Media IPO Allotment Status, Subscription Check","s":"HDFC Sky","d":1789710577,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE5TNTd6eEdMbkdKdXdWQURqcGhHNWlMUXNpW